sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Op as Operation (service)
    participant Outbox as OutboxService/Tx
    participant DB as Postgres
    participant Drain as OutboxDrainProcessor
    participant CL as ChangeLog
    participant Sync as SyncController

    Op->>DB: Mutate business data (in transaction)
    Op->>Outbox: Write OutboxEvent (type, aggregate, payload IDs only)
    DB-->>Op: Committed
    Drain->>DB: Claim PENDING outbox events
    Drain->>Drain: Dispatch by type
    Drain->>CL: Write ChangeLog entries (resourceType, resourceId, op, version, requiredPermission, outboxEventId, seq)
    Drain->>DB: Mark OutboxEvent PUBLISHED
    Sync->>CL: Query ChangeLog by seq cursor since last sync
    Sync->>Sync: Filter by caller permissions
    Sync-->>Client: Change feed entries
    Note over CL: seq is monotonic bigint cursor (collation-proof)
    Note over CL: requiredPermission stored for read-path filtering
    Note over Outbox: Payload contains IDs only
